                <p class="dataHdr">User Notes</p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Geographic codes are based on TIGER 2023.</li>

                    <li>Locale assignments are based on inputs from TIGER 2023.</li>

                    <li>Congressional district codes represent the 118th Congress.</li>

                    <li>CBSA and CSA codes are based on the U.S. Office of Management and Budget's (OMB) July 2023 metropolitan and micropolitan area components.</li>

                </ol>
