                <p class="dataHdr">User Notes</p>
                <ol>
                    <li>Geographic codes are based on TIGER 2022, except for CBSA and CSA codes which are based on TIGER 2021.</li>
                    <li>Locale assignments are based on inputs from TIGER 2021.</li>
                    <li>Congressional district codes represent the 116th Congress.</li>
					<li>CBSA and CSA codes are based on the U.S. Office of Management and Budget's (OMB) March 2020 metropolitan and micropolitan area standards.</li>
					<li>The Census Bureau discontinued New England City and Town Areas (NECTA) as a reported entity in TIGER.</li>
					<li>Connecticut replaced its 8 counties with 9 county-equivalent entities.</li>
                </ol>
