                <p class="dataHdr">User Notes</p>
				<ol>
					<li>The public school and school district point files are based on an October 1st, 2019 benchmark. This did not include 70 schools and 39 school district offices in California that were reported later to the CCD directory. The public school and school district point files were subsequently updated and re-released on March 30th, 2020.</li>
					<li>Geographic codes are based on TIGER 2018.</li>
					<li>Congressional district codes represent the 116th Congress.</li>
					<li>CBSA and CSA codes are based on the U.S. Office of Management and Budget's (OMB) August 2017 metropolitan and micropolitan area components.</li>
				</ol>
