                <p class="dataHdr">User Notes</p>
				<ol>
					<li>Geographic codes are based on TIGER 2017.</li>
					<li>Congressional district codes represent the 115th Congress.</li>
					<li>TIGER 2017 uses the United States Office of Management and Budget (OMB) updates to metropolitan and micropolitan delineations as of July 15, 2015.</li>
					<li>The 2017-18 Private School Survey (PSS) data files include seven private schools that are not included in the EDGE Private School Location files. These seven cases became "survey eligible" after the school location files were completed. The PPINs for these cases are 00262259, 00299755, 00599908, A1101006, A1502929, A1592104, and A1771210.</li>
				</ol>
